('m-in-01-1', 'rest-in-01', 'Dal Bukhara', 'Whole black lentils, tomatoes, ginger, and garlic slow-simmered for 18 hours on charcoal embers with churned butter.', 650, 'Main Course', 'Pure Veg,Vegetarian,Gluten-Free', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546833999-b9f581a1996d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80', TRUE),
